+The build requires both hardened custom-engine libraries, the matching offline
+Ed25519 signing key outside this repository, and `android/key.properties`.
+Gradle invokes the Dart packer and native signer after Flutter compiles the
+release assets, links the signed payload into `libpayload.so` for both ABIs,
+stages the custom `libflutter.so`, and excludes `flutter_assets` from the APK.
+Android's normal release packaging signs the output at
+`build/app/outputs/flutter-apk/app-release.apk`. The build fails if the final
+APK contains unpacked Flutter assets or an unexpected ABI.
